# SARA evaluator API

This file is the evaluator-facing contract. The required scope and output below
are fixed; add factual inputs, internal variables, and section subscopes without
renaming or removing them.

- Requirement ID `SARA-TOTAL-TAX`: scope `TotalTax`, output `total_tax`.

